                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="margin-right:0;text-indent:0;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">各</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">位教师</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 16px">：</span></p><p style="margin-right:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:33px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">接《绍兴市教育教学研究院关于绍兴市（市直）杰出教师培育库（</span><span style="font-family:仿宋">B类人才）遴选的通知》，</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">为加快构建我市教师的梯队培育体系，提升全市中小学教师的综合育人能力，切实推进绍兴教育高质量发展，决定举行绍兴市杰出教师培育库（</span>B类人才）遴选活动，现将有关事项通知如下：</span></p><p style="margin-left:0;text-indent:34px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 黑体;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">一、遴选范围和名额</span></p><p style="margin-right:3px;margin-left:0;text-indent:33px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">范围</span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">：绍兴市中小学、幼儿园在职教师和教研人员。浙江省</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">特级教师和正高级教师属当然的杰出教师培育库（</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">B</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">类人才）</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">及</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 16px">绍兴市学科带头人，不再参与遴选。教研员单独推荐，单独考评。</span></p><p style="margin-right:3px;margin-left:0;text-indent:35px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">名额：</span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">按一定的教师比例分配到学段、学科（详见</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">附件</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">2</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: -5px;font-size: 16px">），</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">最终将根据各学科申报和推荐的实际情况对分</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">配名额作相应调</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 16px">整。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">镜湖校区不超过</span><span style="font-family:仿宋">4人，龙山校区和龙山书院总共不超过4人。</span></span></p><p style="margin-left:0;text-indent:34px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 黑体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">二、遴选条件</span></p><p style="margin-right:7px;margin-left:0;text-indent:33px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">推荐人选必须师德高尚，坚持把立德树人贯穿于教书育人全过程；必须具有崇高的职业理想和坚定的职业信念，模范履行中小学教师职业道德规范；具有精湛的教学能力和较强的教育科研能力，积极投入教育教学改革，并取得显著业绩与成效，学科指导与示范引领作用明显，在市内外具有较高知名度和影响力。绍</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">兴市杰出教师培育库（</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">B</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">类人才）遴选的基本条件如下：</span></p><p style="margin-right:7px;margin-left:0;text-indent:33px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">（一）持有相应的教师资格证书，学科教师职称应与申报学</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">科相一致（德育、综合实践活动及心理健康教育学科除外）。中</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">小学、幼儿园教师需在近五年中连续承担相应教育教学任务（其中德育申报对象应连续五年担任班主任、心理健康教育或德育管</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">理工作</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: -4px;font-size: 16px">）；</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">教研员需连续担任该学科专职教研员</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">3</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">年及以上。</span></p><p style="margin-left:0;text-indent:34px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">（二）教书育人工作业绩和成效突出。获得过区、县（市）</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 16px">级及以上各类教书育人成果（师德或学术方面）。</span></p><p style="margin-right:7px;margin-left:0;text-indent:33px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">（三）有比较丰富的专业知识、较高的教育理论素养和教育</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">教学科研能力，学生、家长满意率高。主持过绍兴市级及以上教科研课题，并在近五年内至少有两篇（教研员至少三篇）与申报学科（专业）相一致的教育教学论文、优秀案例、调研报告等标</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">志性教研成果（每篇不少于</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">2000</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">字）在省级及以上公</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">开刊物发</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">表或获省一等奖及以上（</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">B</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">类学科放宽至获绍兴市一等奖或省二</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">等奖及以上）。在指导学生方面，也有丰富的育人成果。</span></p><p style="margin-right:10px;margin-left:0;text-indent:32px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">（四）需提交文稿</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">《我的教学主张》</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">：结合</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16px">学科新课程标准，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">就学科教学的某一问题谈</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">教学主张的基本内涵</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">”“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">教学主张的实</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">施策略</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">和</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">教学主张的实践案例</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">。教研人员还需提交富有成效</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">的教研活动案例</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">份。</span></p><p style="margin-left:0;text-indent:34px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 黑体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">三、遴选方法和程序</span></p><p style="margin-left:0;text-indent:34px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">遴选工作分为</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">四</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">个阶段：</span></p><p style="text-indent:34px;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(255,0,0);letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">第一阶段：校内遴选</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">。有意参加遴选的老师请联系赵正瑜老师。每</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">位参评教师提交《学术荣誉申报对象业绩量化表》及佐证材料（含目录）纸质材料一式一份，电子稿同步通过钉钉报送给沈初见老师，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(255,0,0);letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">截止时间</span><span style="font-family:仿宋">11月19日17：00。材料不全、格式不符、签章不齐或逾期报送者，视为无效申报，不予进入评审程序。</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">学校根据实际申报情况，在选拔推荐时做好学科间的平衡。</span></p><p style="margin-right:3px;margin-left:0;text-indent:34px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">第</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">二</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">阶段：在教师申报和学校推荐的基础上，由各区、县（市）教育局严格按照遴选条件，在组织全面考核的基础上按分配名额推荐（详见附件</span>3），并提供推荐对象的课堂教学能力区域评价结果（A等占20%，B等占30%，C等占50%）。推荐名额不能突破，条件不足允许空缺。近五年来，在师德等方面存在问题的，实行一票否决。</span></p><p style="margin-right:3px;margin-left:0;text-indent:34px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">第</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">三</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">阶段：市教育教学研究院组织专家组对各区、县（市）</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">教研室、市直学校推荐的候选人进行申报条件的资格审核，并对</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">其学科教学能力和科研能力进行评估。</span></p><p style="margin-left:0;text-indent:33px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">第</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">四</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">阶段：市教育教学研究院在综合研判基础上最终确定入</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">选名单，经名单公示、处理异议后发文公布。</span></p><p style="margin-left:0;text-indent:34px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 黑体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">四、报送材料及要求</span></p><p style="margin-right:2px;margin-left:0;text-indent:33px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">（一）</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(255,0,0);letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">待第一阶段遴选结束后</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;letter-spacing:0;font-size:16px">遴选推荐对象需上报以下材料：</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">《绍兴市（直）杰出</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 16px">教师培育库（</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 16px">B</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 16px">类人才）遴选推荐表》（详见附件</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 16px">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 16px">）、参选教师</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">的师德及廉政情况鉴定意见表（详见附件</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">4</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">）、</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">汇总表（</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">详见附件</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">5）、</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">教师资格</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">证书和</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">职称证书复印件、文稿</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">我的教学主张</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">（德育、职教提供专题经</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">验总结与事迹介绍）、课题成果、论文著述（论</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">文需提交</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">知网</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">转载的佐证材料）、各类教书育人成果证明、教学比赛获奖证书</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">复印件。教研人员需提交教研活动案例</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">份。</span></p><p style="margin-right:6px;margin-left:0;text-indent:33px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">（二）上述各类申报材料的有效截止日期为</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">2026</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">年</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">8</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">月</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">30</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: -2px;font-size: 16px">日。</span></p><p style="margin-right:6px;margin-left:0;text-indent:33px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">（三）在遴选或公示中如发现有弄虚作假等违规情况，取消</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">遴选资格，且在近五年内不得参与市级学科带头人遴选。</span></p><p style="margin-left:0;text-indent:34px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 黑体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">五、选拔工作要求</span></p><p style="margin-left:0;text-indent:33px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">《绍兴市（</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">市直</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">）杰出教师培育库（</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">B</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">类人才）遴选是一项严</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 16px">肃的工作，对于加快建设学科领军教师队伍，培育教育教学品</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 16px">牌，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">具有积极意义。各区、县（市）教研室和市直学校要加强领</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">导，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 16px">精心组织，周密安排，充分发动和依靠广大教师，真正把师德</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 16px">好、</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">业务强，能在学科建设中起带头作用的教师推荐出来，确保遴选质量。职教、特教等学校由各区、县（市）教研室牵头协同相关</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">职能处室做好遴选工作。</span></p><p style="text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:107%"><span style="font-family: Arial;line-height: 107%;font-size: 12px"> </span></p><p style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family: Arial;line-height: 107%;font-size: 12px"> </span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">附件：</span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">绍兴市（直）杰出教师培育库（</span>B类人才）遴选推荐表</span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px"></span></p><p style="line-height: 16px;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif" /><a style="font-size:12px; color:#0066cc;" href="/downloads/xwzx/2026/11/202611111426286960.docx" title="202611111426286960.docx">202611111426286960.docx</a></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px"></span>
</p><p style=";text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">2.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">绍兴市杰出教师培育库（</span>B类人才）遴选学科名额分配表</span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px"></span></p><p style="line-height: 16px;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif" /><a style="font-size:12px; color:#0066cc;" href="/downloads/xwzx/2026/11/202611111426398897.docx" title="202611111426398897.docx">202611111426398897.docx</a></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px"></span>
</p><p style=";text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">3.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">绍兴市（直）杰出教师培育库（</span>B类人才）遴选区、县（市）推荐名额分配表</span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px"></span></p><p style="line-height: 16px;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif" /><a style="font-size:12px; color:#0066cc;" href="/downloads/xwzx/2026/11/202611111427037425.docx" title="202611111427037425.docx">202611111427037425.docx</a></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px"></span>
</p><p style=";text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">4.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">绍兴市（直）杰出教师培育库（</span>B类人才）遴选师德及廉政情况鉴定意见表</span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px"></span></p><p style="line-height: 16px;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif" /><a style="font-size:12px; color:#0066cc;" href="/downloads/xwzx/2026/11/202611111427387316.docx" title="202611111427387316.docx">202611111427387316.docx</a></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px"></span>
</p><p style=";text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">5.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">绍兴市（直）杰出教师培育库（</span>B类人才）遴选区、县（市）推荐名单汇总表</span></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px"></span></p><p style="line-height: 16px;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif" /><a style="font-size:12px; color:#0066cc;" href="/downloads/xwzx/2026/11/202611111427573388.docx" title="202611111427573388.docx">202611111427573388.docx</a></p><p style=";text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px"></span>
</p><p style="margin-left:0;text-indent:34px;text-autospace:none;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px"> </span></p><p>
